BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.67 Tm (addition means newly observed delegation, not necessarily a newly registered domain: transfers, restored delegations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 219.45 Tm (and prior snapshot gaps create false triggers. Preserve the previous snapshot and classify additions before enrichment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 204.22 Tm (The .us registry sits outside any assumption that CZDS supplies every top-level domain. Discover its authoritative) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 189.00 Tm (RDAP service through the IANA bootstrap file, inspect actual response fields, and respect redaction and access policy.) Tj ET
